   319	subroutine uses the grid-optimal τ′ for the same C_γ; the reported value is the upper bracket):
   320	
   321	| C_γ | inf c_U (grid, upper) | c_DL (grid, upper) | outer τ = (a, κ, d₀) | 3a | binding term |
   322	|---|---|---|---|---|---|
   323	| 0 | 3.51035 | 3.51035 | (11/20, 3/20, 23/20) | 1.65 | shape test (special-q within 10^{−5}) |
