   102	    """Lemma C25(i): with the subroutine at the same tuple, c_DL <= max(3a, c_U) (checked on the upper brackets;
   103	    the inequality a + s + 2^{-2/5} c_U <= c_U holds because (a+s) <= (1 - 2^{-2/5}) c_U)."""
