   272	  - Fix an LLL-reduced basis u_1..u_{r_U} of Λ_U (only for the proof). Its Gram–Schmidt norms are ≥ 2^{−r_U/2}β_d.
   273	  - So the integer coordinates c_{ji} of v_j satisfy |c_{ji}| ≤ 2^{O(d²)}‖v_j‖/β_d.
