   280	    - Lower: |σ_i(a − bα)| = |N(a − bα)|/∏_{j≠i}|σ_j(a − bα)| ≥ (|F(a,b)|/|t|)/U^{d−1} ≥ p^{−O(d)}.
   281	    So log R = O_d(β_x + log p). The same lower bound shows that absolute precision κ + β_x + O(d log p) bits on the
   282	    roots of f gives the relative precision needed for the logs.
   283	- **LLL.** Let b_j := (e_j, ⌊2^κ v_j⌉) ∈ Z^{s+r₁+r₂}, where ⌊2^κ v_j⌉ is any integer vector within 1 of 2^κ v_j in
   284	  each coordinate (computed from approximations).
