   300	  passes, by the precision. A non-relation cannot pass, by the gap. ∎
   301	
   302	**Lemma XK5 (torsion ⇒ known logarithm).** For x ∈ Λ₂, W(x) ∈ μ_{2w}(F_p), where w := |μ_K|. For d odd, μ_K = {±1},
