   177	(i) ϱ(z₂) ≤ 2ϱ(z₁); (ii) ϱ(z₁) ≤ (log N)^{C_U(C+1)}ϱ(z₂), with C_U absolute;
   178	(iii) for fixed Z ≥ 1, Ψ(z₁(1 + 1/Z)) − Ψ(z₁) ≥ Ψ(z₁)/(3Z), and Ψ(z₁/2) ≥ Ψ(z₁)/3;
   179	(iv) log(1/ϱ(z)) = u_z log u_z (1 + o(1)), u_z = log z/log B.
