   219	**Lemma F (solving the recursion) [proved].** Throughout, write L_x := exp(√(log x·max(1, log log x))). This is the
   220	usual L_x for x ≥ e^e, and it is ≥ 1 everywhere. Fix after the critic: L_x is undefined for x < e.
