   222	  F(x) ≤ L_x^{p+ε(x)} + L_x^{δ+ε(x)}F(√(2x)), with ε(x) → 0.
   223	- Conclusion: F(x) ≤ L_x^{c+o(1)}, where c = max(p, δ/(1 − 1/√2)) = max(p, (2 + √2)δ).
