     4	2Y^2 < p.  For T in F_p^* let E(T) be the event that the Gauss-reduced shortest nonzero vector of
     5	Lambda_T = {(u, v) in Z^2 : u = T v (mod p)} is +-(u, v) with u, v in S and gcd(u, v) = 1.  Then
     6	   #{T : E(T)} = #{(u, v) in S^2 : gcd(u, v) = 1} =: P'        (exact identity, proved)
     7	and P' >= |S|^2 (1 - 2k^3/|G|) when |S| >= C(|G|, k)/(2k)    (so Pr[E] >= |S|^2/(2(p - 1)) if |G| >= 4k^3).
     8	
     9	DIAGNOSTIC/HARNESS code (uses only public data; no secrets are involved in this lemma).
    10	"""
    11	from __future__ import annotations
    12	
    13	import itertools
    14	import json
